### Health
GET http://localhost:8080/actuator/health

### Trilhas públicas
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/courses

### Currículo de uma trilha
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/courses/1/curriculum

### Cadastro
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Aluno TechMind",
  "email": "aluno@techmind.dev",
  "password": "senha123"
}

### Login
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "aluno@techmind.dev",
  "password": "senha123"
}

> {% client.global.set("token", response.body.accessToken); %}

### Perfil autenticado
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Matricular na trilha 1
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/enrollments/courses/1
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Minhas matrículas
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/enrollments/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Meu progresso detalhado na trilha
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/learning/courses/1/progress
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Concluir aula
# Troque {lessonId} por um ID retornado pelo endpoint de currículo.
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/learning/lessons/1/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Progresso agregado
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/progress/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
